<p>Web excursions brought to you in partnership with <a href="https://www.git-tower.com/?via=brett">Tower</a>, the absolute best Git GUI for macOS.</p>

<dl>
  <dt><a href="https://taphouse.io/arborist/">Arborist - Taphouse Software</a></dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <p>A native macOS command center for git repositories and worktrees.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
  <dd>
    <p>A great way to manage multiple worktrees and maintain agent context between them. Works great with <a href="https://www.git-tower.com/">Tower</a> as an external tool using the built-in command options.</p>
  </dd>
  <dt><a href="https://psychosonicconsulting.com/bibliome">Bibliome — a library that shelves itself</a></dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <p>Turn scattered PDFs into a tidy, searchable library — sorted by topic, searchable by meaning, able to answer questions with citations. All on your Mac. $29.99 one-time; free iPhone &amp; iPad companion.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
  <dt><a href="https://peeku.app/">Peeku - Private Mac Presence and Auto Lock</a></dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <p>Peeku is a private Mac workspace companion that locks your screen when you walk away, nudges you to walk and rest your eyes, and keeps camera processing local.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
  <dd>
    <p>The auto-lock feature works on both the direct version and recently the MAS version.</p>
  </dd>
  <dt><a href="https://www.minibase.md/">Minibase — Web to Markdown for Claude, ChatGPT &amp; Obsidian</a></dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <p>The Chrome extension that clips any webpage to clean Markdown — YouTube, Reddit, X, docs. Built for Obsidian, Claude, and AI knowledge bases.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
  <dd>
    <p>And yes, there&rsquo;s a <a href="https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/minibase-web-clipper/">Firefox/Zen extension</a>.</p>
  </dd>
  <dt><a href="https://trymainspring.com/">Mainspring — Tune your Mac</a></dt>
  <dd>
    <blockquote>
      <p>Mainspring reveals the settings macOS hides — as 90+ one-click, fully reversible power-ups, recipes, and scenes. A precision tool for tuning your Mac. $29 once, 1-day free trial.</p>
    </blockquote>
  </dd>
  <dd>
    <p>A nice update to tools like Onyx, with easy reversion of changes.</p>
  </dd>
</dl>

